* NEW m32 differential fuzzer (tests/fuzz/m32_differential_fuzz.py):
  libc-free codegen fuzz vs gcc -m32 with a nostdlib _start driver
  folding 17 calls into the exit code; div/mod/shifts/helper calls/
  global arrays. 360/360 pass (seeds 0:120, O0+O2+Os).
* Runtime reproducers all exit 0: mulhaz (idiv+imul), gep0 (a[i]),
  fptest (F64 loop), storeind (global stores).
* Kernel repro szt.c -Os -m32: 1944 -> 1833 bytes (-5.7%; GCC 493).
* Full battery: cargo test 687; regression 209; correctness 50;
  linker 86; intrinsics 3; asm-diff exact; x86-64 fuzz 600/600
  (O0+O2+Os, seeds 0:200).
